<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Cenbank liquidates one more brokerage house.</title>
<headline>Brazil Cenbank liquidates one more brokerage house.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank liquidated Sheck brokerage house, based in Rio de Janeiro state, a Central Bank spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman alleged the brokerage was also involved in a multi-million dollar fraud scheme involving municipal and state bonds.</p>
<p>Earlier today the Central Bank announced the liquidation of two banks and 14 brokerage and investment houses.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Rio de Janeiro Newsroom 5521 5074151))</p>
